son and Federal Reserve Board chairman Ben Bernanke with the G-7 leaders; details given of the G-7 agreement. [President BUSH \u2013 comments on anxiety; says we can solve this crisis and we will; comments on the rescue plan.] [Former IMF chief economist Simon JOHNSON\u2020- says there has been criticism against the US from Europe.] The government\u2019s plan to invest in struggling banks noted.  \n\n(New York Stock Exchange: Brian Williams) Report introduced.  \n\n(Naperville, Illinois: Phil LeBeau) The hard times for GM examined. [Car buyer Christy SMITH\u2021- expresses uncertainty about the economy.] [Car dealer Bill KAY\u2020- worries about his business.] [Kelley Blue Book Jack NERAD\u2020- says bankruptcy would be devastating for General Motors\u2019 sales.] [Car buyer Eric ADAMS \u2013 predicts the government will help GM.]  \n\n(New York Stock Exchange: Brian Williams, Maria Bartiromo, Steve Liesman) Investor anxiety, the search for leadership and what else can be done discussed. ", "segment_duration": 610, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920959, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "TKg2z8fDuT", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920958, "segment_id": "tsGQpwIW5x", "segment_broadcast_id": "TKg2z8fDuT", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (New York Stock Exchange: Brian Williams)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63660.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920960, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_c