pended; says Obama is a decent person and you do not have to be scared.] Allegations of voter registration fraud and suppression involving the ACORN group, which has ties to Obama, noted.  \n\n(New York Stock Exchange: Brian Williams) Findings of a \u201cNewsweek\u201d poll on the presidential race cited. ", "segment_duration": 310, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63830.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920962, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "TKg2z8fDuT", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920958, "segment_id": "OewTtwcTgD", "segment_broadcast_id": "TKg2z8fDuT", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (New York Stock Exchange: Brian Williams)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64140.0", "legacy_segment_id": 920963, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "TKg2z8fDuT", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-10", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 920958, "segment_id": "Njx09bMFxu", "segment_broadcast_id": "TKg2z8fDuT", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Actonel; EnergyTomorrow.org; Selsun Blue; Restasis; Healthy Choice; EnergyTomorrow.org.)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64150.